# --- 3. transformers (ML extra, sentence-transformers dependency) ---
# CVE-2024-11392 / -11393 / -11394 are FIXED, not ignored: transformers bumped
# 4.46.3 -> 4.48.0 in requirements-ml.txt (2026-07-22). The two below have no
# 4.x fix (5.3.0 / 5.5.0) and both require loading attacker-supplied models or
# trust_remote_code to exploit. Strata only loads a pinned, first-party-curated
# embedding model from HuggingFace Hub and never sets trust_remote_code. The
# transformers 5.x upgrade is tracked with the sentence-transformers major bump.
CVE-2026-4372
CVE-2026-5241
